  "version_name": "OB683.261128.0",
  "release_notes": "\u2022 Herb and Tree fields now select an available seed, the tabs fit smaller screens, and Herb seeds are sold by the Market Trader.\n\u2022 Field workers check crops every 250 ms and harvest as soon as they are ready.\n\u2022 Cultivation adds 10% Attack and Max Health per breakthrough, up to +1,000% at Immortal Ascension X, and preserves the current health percentage.\n\u2022 Item icons resolve by item name before the old table, fixing mismatches such as a necklace showing a crown; selected item names remain visible.\n\u2022 Cleaned stray edge pixels from the Shadowveil weather icon.",
